      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MBHuU",
      "text": "440",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta & =\\left|\\begin{array}{llc}\n1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 2 & 4 \\\\\n1 & 4 & 10\n\\end{array}\\right|=1(20-16)-1(10-4)+1(4-2) \\\\\n& =4-6+2=0\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nFor infinite solutions\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Delta_x=\\Delta_y=\\Delta_z=0 \\\\\n& m^2-3 x+2=0 \\\\\n& m=1,2 \\\\\n& \\alpha=1, \\beta=2 \\\\\n& \\therefore \\sum_{n=1}^{10}\\left(n^\\alpha+n^\\beta\\right)=\\sum_{n=1}^{10} n^1+\\sum_{n=1}^{10} n^2 \\\\\n&= \\frac{10(11)}{2}+\\frac{10(11)(21)}{6} \\\\\n&= 55+385 \\\\\n&= 440\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
